{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"little-turtles-big-swim","version":1,"title":"Little Turtle’s Big Swim","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"On a warm night, deep in the sand, an egg went crack. A tiny turtle pushed out her head. Her name was Nunu.","sentences":["On a warm night, deep in the sand, an egg went crack.","A tiny turtle pushed out her head.","Her name was Nunu."],"image":"sha256:dfc1f3c0a4349a830a5f890acbe9448f2eb305102c8d7c578308e708d8116860","alt":"A tiny turtle hatchling pushes her head out of a cracked egg in the sand.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:4f40468ad7c5192c9b7abd39dfa2784608106cf2836ab97a9e9469244f87ffbf","durationMs":11720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5958],[5958,9767],[9767,11720]],"words":[[0,195],[195,390],[390,781],[781,1758],[1758,2149],[2149,2344],[2344,2637],[2637,3516],[3516,3711],[3711,4004],[4004,4395],[4395,5958],[5958,6153],[6153,6544],[6544,7130],[7130,7716],[7716,8009],[8009,8302],[8302,9767],[9767,10060],[10060,10451],[10451,10744],[10744,11720]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Nunu climbed up through the sand. All around her, brothers and sisters were climbing too. Scratch, scratch, scratch!","sentences":["Nunu climbed up through the sand.","All around her, brothers and sisters were climbing too.","Scratch, scratch, scratch!"],"image":"sha256:5bb49e8a9a67c4d0f460e2ff7ac421645c504cf4a7cb075da9da196804a9981b","alt":"Many tiny turtles climb out of the sand at night under a moon.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:22771aa6829a3b3d5b846f0fd043d0ae008fe6e501273912c29945d971b3c06e","durationMs":10960,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3062],[3062,7979],[7979,10960]],"words":[[0,322],[322,886],[886,1047],[1047,1611],[1611,1853],[1853,3062],[3062,3304],[3304,3788],[3788,4433],[4433,5078],[5078,5320],[5320,5884],[5884,6206],[6206,6851],[6851,7979],[7979,8946],[8946,9913],[9913,10960]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"The beach was big and dark. Far away, the sea was shining softly. ‘That way,’ whispered Nunu.","sentences":["The beach was big and dark.","Far away, the sea was shining softly.","‘That way,’ whispered Nunu."],"image":"sha256:320fcae04bb73bb4f47bd81cab96b0e7208e2df46a1a8e801ebf04d712d83e8a","alt":"A small turtle looks across a dark beach towards a softly shining sea.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:dbe00eb2b7ca130e69725590fc3f3debbc2b4c8ff20b7164f2e261d3e89bfd4b","durationMs":9080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2689],[2689,6472],[6472,9080]],"words":[[0,252],[252,672],[672,924],[924,1176],[1176,1428],[1428,2689],[2689,2941],[2941,3698],[3698,3950],[3950,4202],[4202,4454],[4454,5043],[5043,6472],[6472,6808],[6808,7481],[7481,8238],[8238,9080]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"She crawled and crawled. A crab clicked its claws. Click, click! Nunu kept going.","sentences":["She crawled and crawled.","A crab clicked its claws.","Click, click!","Nunu kept going."],"image":"sha256:26f1f3bda3dda56a33487c72579354034f93ca04e725323e9c4ca7b91b35ad7b","alt":"The turtle crawls past a small pale crab on the sand.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:a41ca49657a7c169ba61a4b6b85d369fbfb8fa192ab4b6eb43c212964594bd76","durationMs":9320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2675],[2675,5437],[5437,7681],[7681,9320]],"words":[[0,259],[259,863],[863,1122],[1122,2675],[2675,2848],[2848,3193],[3193,3797],[3797,4056],[4056,5437],[5437,6300],[6300,7681],[7681,8026],[8026,8371],[8371,9320]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"A bright light shone from the road. Some turtles turned the wrong way. ‘Follow me,’ called Nunu. ‘The sea is shining!’","sentences":["A bright light shone from the road.","Some turtles turned the wrong way.","‘Follow me,’ called Nunu.","‘The sea is shining!’"],"image":"sha256:b40ddcef81edbbbcaa64bb64c136e3a73f723f171c95771e9f76a197c0c69058","alt":"Some turtles turn towards a bright street light while Nunu leads others towards the sea.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e946d18819171103f70199b602bd4e5fc1695ea35d1ecedb17a1a2c1ede0c235","durationMs":10640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3176],[3176,6273],[6273,8972],[8972,10640]],"words":[[0,159],[159,635],[635,1032],[1032,1429],[1429,1747],[1747,1985],[1985,3176],[3176,3494],[3494,4050],[4050,4526],[4526,4764],[4764,5161],[5161,6273],[6273,6749],[6749,7305],[7305,7781],[7781,8972],[8972,9210],[9210,9448],[9448,9607],[9607,10640]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Splash! The first wave tickled Nunu’s nose. She paddled. Flap, flap, flap!","sentences":["Splash!","The first wave tickled Nunu’s nose.","She paddled.","Flap, flap, flap!"],"image":"sha256:d88c8d1baf04bb1da1a4357abc22d2a78a58a63524e8a7531c29a20518d31286","alt":"A wave washes over the little turtle as she paddles into the sea.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:fb5b8d5b1abac37ae9b2d5f4983a1460c391d0074ba8bae8823e0a43ddaee50c","durationMs":8160,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,1321],[1321,4353],[4353,5985],[5985,8160]],"words":[[0,1321],[1321,1554],[1554,1943],[1943,2254],[2254,2798],[2798,3187],[3187,4353],[4353,4586],[4586,5985],[5985,6684],[6684,7383],[7383,8160]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Up on the beach, a girl named Akpene sat quietly beside her grandfather. She had asked the neighbours to turn off their lights, and they kept their dog away.","sentences":["Up on the beach, a girl named Akpene sat quietly beside her grandfather.","She had asked the neighbours to turn off their lights, and they kept their dog away."],"image":"sha256:84d54461b7574c438dc309ef8af9fb8e52ca2e46011ac555b2b78e31bec7ffa5","alt":"A girl and her grandfather sit quietly on a mat, with the lights off and a sleeping dog.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:405a1cbef0dfd8078edc3c6c1bec7159409742bf8571395a89492483ad00a108","durationMs":11720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5745],[5745,11720]],"words":[[0,153],[153,306]